# Ruling 7 (task-11-brief.md): where the Unit 10 API is running.
#
# `src/api/start.ts:19` binds the API on `Number(process.env.PORT ?? 3000)`,
# and the repo's own `.env` sets no PORT, so the API's real local default is
# http://localhost:3000 -- NOT the UI's own dev port. `web/lib/api.ts` already
# falls back to this exact value when the variable below is unset, so setting
# it is only necessary if you run the API on a non-default port/host.
#
# Must be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ to be readable from browser-rendered code
# (subscribeToActivity's EventSource usage needs it client-side).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
